        <name>precursor</name>
        <qualifiedname>ndigo_trigger_block::precursor</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Precursor in multiples of the device main clock period (3.2ns). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>It is the amount of data preceding a trigger that is captured.</para>
<para>The precursor setting is ignored for the TDC channel.</para>
<para>The maximum allowed value is <ref refid="group__precursordef_1ga761017d18975c9b13e1ea8cf274356a6" kindref="member">NDIGO_MAX_PRECURSOR</ref>.</para>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst:leading-asterisk
